      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WANGARATTA GIRL (4) scored two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 14 length 6th at The Meadows (31.35). Has claims if she runs up to expectations. ABSOLUTE RUPEE (1) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 4th (22.32) at Ballarat. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Better than last start and can bounce back. AMRON TOMMY (2) goes very well at this journey here having never missed the frame including two wins and two placings. Below best last time at Shepparton (25.83) in a Rank Limit - Grade 5, finishing a 6 length sixth. Looks suited here and can measure up. RED TURTLE (8) has top-three aspirations after placing at big odds last time.",
